DESCRIPTION:VIP Demo Experience with Reveleer at NCQA Health Innovation Summit.\n\nIn this session you will see:\n- How Clinical Quality supports annual HEDIS reporting and audit prep through automated retrieval and AI-driven abstraction\n- How Care Gap Manager keeps quality and risk gaps closing year-round\, not just at reporting time\n- How to get ahead of NCQA's shift to fully digital\, ECDS-based reporting\n\nLocation: Georgia World Congress Center\, Atlanta\, GA\nFind us: Reveleer Booth 126\n\nQuestions? Additional colleagues are welcome to join. Email events@reveleer.com.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>VIP Demo Experience with Reveleer at NCQA Health Innovation Summit.</p>
<p>In this session you will see:</p>
<ul>
<li>How Clinical Quality supports annual HEDIS reporting and audit prep through automated retrieval and AI-driven abstraction</li>
<li>How Care Gap Manager keeps quality and risk gaps closing year-round, not just at reporting time</li>
<li>How to get ahead of NCQA&rsquo;s shift to fully digital, ECDS-based reporting</li>
</ul>
<p>Location: Georgia World Congress Center, Atlanta, GA<br>Find us: Reveleer Booth 126</p>
<p>Questions? Additional colleagues are welcome to join. Email <a href="mailto:events@reveleer.com">events@reveleer.com</a>.</p>
